    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21251" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ĭaera</span></b> , ae, f.,
		= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴαιρα</span>, the name of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a sea-nymph</i> or
				<i>Nereid</i>, Hom. Il. 18, 42; but Lat. only as
			the name of <i>an Oread</i> or <i>woodnymph</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sylvestris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 9, 673</span></i>
			; Hyg. Fab. praef.</div>
